28
00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:30.740
Nobody thought this code would still run in 2000.

29
00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:31.920
It did.

30
00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.100
And the two-digit year wasn’t hidden in one module.

31
00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.780
It was copied into every calculation.

32
00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:40.320
So engineers spent years hunting down

33
00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.640
every line that touched a year.

34
00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:45.680
Midnight came… and almost nothing broke,

35
00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.920
because they fixed it in time.

36
00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:50.620
The bill? Billions.

37
00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:55.680
Lesson one: every module should keep a secret.

38
00:03:55.680 --> 00:04:07.367
