54
00:05:39.767 --> 00:05:42.967
♪ Four modules? Six connections. ♪

55
00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:45.407
♪ Eight modules? Twenty-eight. ♪

56
00:05:45.547 --> 00:05:48.107
♪ Let every part depend on every other part, ♪

57
00:05:48.107 --> 00:05:50.647
